    if you have a Thunder or Rock monster in your field or GY, you can destroy 1
    card on the field.\r\n\u25CF Opponent's: Add 1 Thunder or Rock monster from your
    field, GY or banishment to your hand, or if a monster(s) was destroyed by battle
    or card effect this turn, you can add 1 such monster from your Deck instead.\r\nYou
    can only activate 1 \"Superconductive Plasma Blast\" per turn."
